  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mroot><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mroot></math><br />For <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> to be real<br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi></mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math> or <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math> and <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />When <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></math> is negative<br />Hence, the required domain is <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>"
  }
